{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 30, "model_name": "mistralai/mixtral-8x7b-instruct-v0.1", "content": " Upon the break of dawn, thou shalt arise and take a flight bound for the Land of the Rising Sun, Japan.\n\n\nUpon arrival in Tokyo, the bustling metropolis, thou shalt indulge in a traditional Japanese breakfast of fish, rice, and miso soup.\n\n\nExplore the ancient Senso-ji Temple, where incense swirls and flames dance in the morning light. Perchance, thou mayst make an offering and receive a fortuitous charm.\n\n\nWander through the vibrant Asakusa district, where vendors peddle their wares of colorful kimonos and delicate origami.\n\n\nPartake in a lunch of sushi, expertly crafted by the hands of a master sushi chef.\n\n\nIn the afternoon, stroll through the tranquil Hamarikyu Gardens, where the tea houses stand still and the cherry blossoms bloom.\n\n\nAs evening descends, ascend the Mori Tower for a breathtaking view of the city below.\n\n\nDine in the Ginza district, where the streets come alive with the sounds of laughter and the clinking of glasses.\n\n\nOn the second day, journey to the ancient city of Kyoto, the former imperial capital.\n\n\nVisit the Kinkaku-ji Temple, a golden pavilion that gleams in the sun. Marvel at the serenity of the Ryoan-ji Rock Garden, where the mind is stilled in contemplation.\n\n\nPartake in a dinner of kaiseki, a multi-course meal that showcases the artistry of Japanese cuisine.\n\n\nOn the third day, visit the Hiroshima Peace Memorial Park, where the tragic history of the atomic bomb is remembered.\n\n\nPay respects at the cenotaph, where the names of the victims are etched in stone.\n\n\nPartake in a lunch of okonomiyaki, a savory pancake filled with vegetables and seafood.\n\n\nIn the afternoon, embark upon a ferry ride to the sacred island of Miyajima, where the Itsukushima Shrine stands in the sea.\n\n\nAs evening descends, return to Hiroshima and dine on oysters, a local delicacy.\n\n\nOn the final day, rise early and visit the Osaka Castle, a symbol of the power of the shoguns.\n\n\nPartake in a lunch of takoyaki, octopus balls that are crispy on the outside and gooey on the inside.\n\n\nAs the sun sets on the horizon, bid farewell to Japan, a land of beauty and tranquility that will forever be etched in thy memory.", "logprobs": [{"token": "Upon", "logprob": -0.16018113493919373}, {"token": "the", "logprob": -0.013940464705228806}, {"token": "break", "logprob": -1.4145479202270508}, {"token": "of", "logprob": -1.311301275563892e-06}, {"token": "dawn", "logprob": -0.04357367381453514}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.0002896366349887103}, {"token": "thou", "logprob": -0.02207924984395504}, {"token": "sh", "logprob": -0.0010748092317953706}, {"token": "alt", "logprob": -1.6689286894688848e-06}, {"token": "arise", "logprob": -0.03864968568086624}, {"token": "and", "logprob": -7.152531907195225e-06}, {"token": "take", "logprob": -2.7135274410247803}, {"token": "a", "logprob": -1.712344765663147}, {"token": "flight", "logprob": -0.284259557723999}, {"token": "bound", "logprob": -4.050178527832031}, {"token": "for", "logprob": -0.00018904806347563863}, {"token": "the", "logprob": -0.0640731006860733}, {"token": "Land", "logprob": -1.3304182291030884}, {"token": "of", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "the", "logprob": -1.4305104514278355e-06}, {"token": "R", "logprob": -1.0728830375228426e-06}, {"token": "ising", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "Sun", "logprob": -5.960462772236497e-07}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.018164711073040962}, {"token": "Japan", "logprob": -0.13122503459453583}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -0.0003022690652869642}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -0.9851481318473816}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -0.2828676700592041}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -0.20185503363609314}, {"token": "U", "logprob": -0.005819757468998432}, {"token": "pon", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "arrival", "logprob": -0.02740814909338951}, {"token": "in", "logprob": -0.012800551019608974}, {"to